{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜旅發局公布繽紛冬日巡禮詳情／北區區議會商大學城及香園圍企業園\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261110.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】旅發局年度旗艦節慶盛事繽紛冬日巡禮下周三揭幕，旅發局今日(11月10日)公布活動詳情。另外，北區區議會開會討論打鼓嶺新發展區最新發展建議，包括大學城及香園圍企業園。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.621378+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:29:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:05:37.833866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:13.356518+00:00","content_hash":"19cd36f44b0ae745846581cf9c591bc7bdd811f47b8bce4e58f6941cbabb9680","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}